            <ArticleTitle>Wilderness Medical Society practice guidelines for the treatment of acute pain in remote environments.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>41-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1016/j.wem.2013.10.001</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">S1080-6032(13)00267-6</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Wilderness Medical Society convened an expert panel to develop evidence-based guidelines for the management of pain in austere environments. Recommendations are graded based on the quality of supporting evidence as defined by criteria put forth by the American College of Chest Physicians.</AbstractText>
